      "framing": "medium, slow push-in following the courier to the bench",
      "prompt": "The courier walks in from the left carrying the parcel in both hands and crosses to the workbench in the centre of the room, the camera easing in behind her. Sawdust turns in the air.",
      "targetDurationSeconds": 5.1667,
      "startState": "Courier in the doorway with the parcel.",
